    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d39">

                <pb facs="0059" n="47" sameAs="frus:frus1939v01/pg47"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">860F.00/703a: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Secretary of State
                        to the Minister in Czechoslovakia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Carr</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1939-03-17T13:00:00-05:00">March 17, 1939—1
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>14. The Department would appreciate receiving from you as soon as you can prepare
                    it a telegram somewhat along the following lines, but in greater factual
                    detail.</p>
                <quote rend="blockquote">
                    <p>Since Bohemia and Moravia have been occupied by Germany which has declared a
                        protectorate and sent military officials to assume the functions of
                        government; since Slovakia, through her President, has asked Hitler to
                        assume a protectorate, and since Ruthenia is now occupied by Hungarian
                        troops, there are no Czechoslovak officials with whom you can carry on
                        business. In the circumstances you request instructions as to your future
                        activities.</p>
                </quote>
                <p>Upon receipt of such a telegram we shall reply directing you to close the
                    Legation and turn over the files and archives to the Consul General, and to
                    return to Washington at your convenience.</p>
                <p>Your telegram should be drafted in such form that if we desire it can be given
                    publicity.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Welles</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
